    title: "Corfu Bag Crochet Pattern Intermediate/Advanced Botanical & Embossed Bag",
    description: "Create a stunning botanical-inspired tapestry and embossed crochet bag with the Corfu Bag pattern by Natalia Kononova. This advanced-intermediate project features gorgeous embossed leaf and fish motifs, spiral cord handles, and structured backing.   ",
    author: "crochet art",
    patternText: `<div><h2>Corfu Bag Crochet Pattern</h2><p><strong>Designer:</strong> Natalia Kononova[cite: 52]. <strong>Skill Level:</strong> Intermediate/Advanced[cite: 52].</p><h3>Materials and Tools</h3><ul><li>DK weight yarn (Scheepjes Catona): 4 skeins Silver Blue (Yarn1) and 7 skeins Moon Rock (Yarn2)[cite: 52].</li><li>Crochet hook: 2.75mm[cite: 52].</li><li>Buckram interfacing for upper edge[cite: 52].</li></ul><h3>Bag Bottom</h3><p>Inc Rnd 1: with Yarn2 ch4, ss in 1st ch, ch2, 8dc in ch4-ring, ss in 2nd ch of beg ch-2 (9dc)[cite: 54]. Inc Rnd 2: ch2, F2i in beg ch-2 from pr, 8 F2i, sk ch-2, ss (18F)[cite: 54]. Inc Rnd 3: ch2, F2i in 1st F from pr, F, [F2i, F]x8, ss (27sts)[cite: 55].</p><strong>get pdf for full pattern</strong></div>`,
