    author: "crochet art",
    patternText: `<div><h2>Caron Short Sleeved Top Crochet Pattern</h2><p><strong>Skill Level:</strong> Easy[cite: 30]. <strong>Sizes:</strong> XS/S to 4/5XL[cite: 30]. <strong>Materials Needed:</strong> Caron Skinny Cakes yarn (Fruit Punch &amp; Cupcake), Size U.S. H/8 (5 mm) crochet hook, tapestry needle[cite: 30].</p><h3>Part 1: Front &amp; Back Panels (Make 2 Alike)</h3><p>With Contrast A, chain 71 (83-89-98-104-122)[cite: 31]. <strong>1st row:</strong> (RS). 1 sc in 2nd ch from hook, 1 sc in each ch to end, turn[cite: 31]. <strong>2nd row:</strong> Ch 3, 1 dc in first sc, *skip next 2 sc, 3 dc in next sc; rep from * to last 3 sc, skip next 2 sc, 2 dc in last sc, drop A, join B, turn[cite: 31].</p></div><strong>get pdf for full pattern</strong>`,
